
1) ALAYON HOTLINES
Format:
ALAYON HOTLINE [Department/Agency/Personnel] [Details: Area, Name, Address, Description]
ALAYON HOTLINE CREATE [Department/Agency/Personnel] [Details: Area, Name, Address, Description]


1) ALAYON ELECTION
Format:
ALAYON ELECTION [Query Type] [Candidate/Details]

Precinct Finder: ALAYON ELECTION PRECINCT [LAST NAME, FIRST NAME]
Candidate Finder: ALAYON ELECTION CANDIDATE [POSITION/BALOT#] [LAST NAME, FIRST NAME]
Candidate Registration: ALAYON ELECTION CREATE CANDIDATE [Name] [Position] [Location]
Support/Answer Survey: ALAYON ELECTION SUPPORT [Name] [Position] [Location]


1) ALAYON PUBLIC ASSISTANCE
Format:
ALAYON ASSISTANCE [Service Type] [Details: Name, Location, Request]

Example Queries:
List of Public Assistance Programs: ALAYON ASSISTANCE (Displays available programs)
Medical Assistance: ALAYON ASSISTANCE MEDICAL Request for financial aid for surgery at Barangay 5.
Scholarship Inquiry: ALAYON ASSISTANCE SCHOLARSHIP Are there available college grants?
Food Relief Request: ALAYON ASSISTANCE FOOD RELIEF Urgent food assistance needed at Barangay 7.
Public Service Request: ALAYON CREATE ASSISTANCE [Type] [Details]
Example: ALAYON CREATE ASSISTANCE LIVELIHOOD PROGRAM for Farmers in Tacloban City
